%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Authorized operator
    participant S as Server
    participant A as Agent
    participant K as Platform credential store

    O->>S: Request one-time enrollment token
    S-->>O: Deliver token through authorized channel
    O-->>A: Provision token
    A->>S: Enroll over HTTPS with token
    S->>S: Atomically consume token and register agent
    S-->>A: Issue individual rotatable credential
    A->>K: Protect credential
    A->>S: Authenticate and publish manifest
    S-->>A: Acknowledge registration

    Note over A,S: Rotation and revocation are audited
    S-->>A: Request or announce credential rotation
    A->>S: Authenticate and complete rotation flow
    S->>S: Revoke superseded credential under controlled policy
